    <Paragraph Type="Action" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1.5"><Text Font="Courier Prime" Size="12">Luz &amp; sombra. </Text><Text Font="Courier Prime" Size="12" Style="Bold+Italic">Sinal &lt;azul&gt;.</Text></Paragraph>
